en's Healthcare Contraception Endometriosis Femtech Fertility Vaginal infections Menopause Uterine fibroids Cardiovascular OTC Products Wide range of therapies for women With in-house active ingredient manufacturing and a comprehensive product portfolio, Richter offers an innovative therapeutic solution for every age group and condition. Sustainability Sustainability Long-term thinking and continuous innovation are stable building blocks of Gedeon Richter’s history. We believe that we should meet the needs of the present in such a way that future generations can turn to us with confidence. Visit this section Governance Board of Directors and Supervisory Board Ethics and compliance Patient safety Clinical trials Responsible marketing Quality management Drug safety Employees Supplier Sustainability Occupational health and safety Environmental protection Climate change CSR initiatives Richter for Women Richter Health City Employee recognition IUPAC-Richter Prize in Medicinal Chemistry Strong corporate culture Our human resources form the basis on which our continuous business success and organic growth can be built. We are proud that the Richter name stands not only for innovative products, but also a stable and friendly workplace. Investors Investors Richter has delivered sustained growth and solid performance for decades. Building on our international presence, innovative product portfolio, and responsible corporate governance, we create long-term sustainable value for our shareholders. Visit this section Reports and presentations Annual reports Announcements AGM Stock information Financial calendar Contact Consistent value creation Richter is a leading blue-chip Company on the Budapest Stock Exchange and one of Europe’s foremost mid-pharma players. Career Procurement Partnering Media share price: $(function() { if (!window.sharePriceRequested) { window.sharePriceRequested = true; window.sharePriceRequestSuccess = $.Deferred(); var parameters = new Object(); paramete